<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lankan stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lankan stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Colombo Stock Exchange is closed on Thursday for a Buddhist holiday. Trading will resume on Friday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday the all share index closed 3.32 points higher at 577.70 on foreign buying of blue chips.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
